      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEBASTIANS WAITING (8) won two back at Kilmore from a nice gate. Drew wide last start and was safely held when seventh at Kilmore over 2180m but tipping he will enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw, with the sprint lane in play, and he can make amends. DISTANT SUN (7) finished second last start over 2180m at Kilmore, beaten 3.5 metres, after a good win at Kilmore the run prior. Will need a bit of luck negotiating the draw but he should be around the mark. KYVALLEY MICHAEL NZ (9) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished 15 metres away in sixth over 2240m at this track. He is capable of turning things around while SCAR (4) must be included on the back of some solid recent form, most recently when second at Geelong over 2100m.",
